% Frozen decision-layer conventions shared by the Scout ranking and finance-engine modules.
% These declarations are the interface freeze for Segment 6 (Scout ranking and finance).
% Changing a declaration here is an interface change and requires foundation-owner review before any module is regenerated.

<decision_domain_types>

```ts
/** ISO 8601 timestamp string, e.g. "2026-07-25T22:00:00Z". Decision-layer modules never read a clock; time is always an input. */
type IsoTimestamp = string;

/**
 * Exact decimal literal: optional leading "-", one or more digits, optionally followed by "." and one or more digits.
 * Exponent notation, whitespace, thousands separators, and empty fraction parts are malformed.
 */
type DecimalString = string;

/**
 * SHA-256 hex digest (64 lowercase hex characters) of the canonical JSON serialization of the module's declared
 * hash material. Canonical JSON: object keys sorted lexicographically by Unicode code point, array order preserved,
 * no insignificant whitespace, strings and numbers serialized per JSON.stringify.
 */
type InputHash = string;
```

</decision_domain_types>
